# apps/mcp-server — local stdio/HTTP entry points for the MCP server.
#
# For the primary stdio workflow (Claude Code / MCP-aware clients via .mcp.json),
# use the root .env.mcp.local.example instead — copy it to .env.mcp.local and
# `source` it. See docs/en/reference/mcp-server/setup.md.
#
# The vars below only matter for local HTTP-mode testing (Mode 3 in setup.md —
# HTTP + tunnel, e.g. testing Claude.ai web against your local server). All
# have working defaults; nothing here is required for the default stdio mode.

# MCP_TRANSPORT=http
# MCP_HTTP_PORT=3001
# MCP_OAUTH_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
# AUTH_APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3004
